    "t": "<p>I ett resonansrör med ena änden stängd uppstår två närliggande resonanslägen när luftpelaren är 16,8 cm respektive 53,3 cm. Stämgaffelns frekvens är 467 Hz. Bestäm ljudhastigheten i försöket.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 319.1 165.27\" width=\"240\" height=\"124.3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Resonansrör med vatten; två resonanslängder mäts.\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Resonansrör med vatten; två resonanslängder mäts.</title><g transform=\"translate(-7.9,-34.98)\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"68.3\" width=\"180\" height=\"55.4\" fill=\"#D6E2F0\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"282.08\" y=\"68.3\" width=\"27.92\" height=\"55.4\" fill=\"#D6E2F0\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><line x1=\"282.08\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"282.08\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"143\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">16,8 cm</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"282.08\" y2=\"171\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"282.08\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"282.08\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"171.04\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">53,3 cm</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">vatten</text><path d=\"M 32 70 L 32 100 M 44 70 L 44 100 M 38 100 L 38 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 32 100 Q 38 106 44 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">467 Hz</text></g></svg></span>",
    "s": "<p>Mellan två närliggande resonanslägen skiljer en halv våglängd.</p><p>λ/2=0,533−0,168=0,365 m ⇒ λ=0,730 m.</p><p>v=fλ=467·0,730=<strong>341 m/s</strong>.</p>"
